#   src\core\DRagLint.Core.ForwardStub.pas`, classifying the one changed line:
#
#       comment lines changed     : 2 (1 removed + 1 added, both inside the
#                                    file's header `{ }` block comment, line 20)
#       NON-comment lines changed : 0
#
#   Zero. No routine body changed -- the file's own logic (PairForwardStubs,
#   FoldForwardStubs, the THasChildrenFn type) below the header comment is
#   untouched -- so every resolve pass derives exactly the same call_edges /
#   type_ancestors / type_helpers / unit_uses rows it derived before, and no
